  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#ACTIVATOR WLKP &#x2013; Supporting Migrant Integration in Wielkopolska Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to facilitating migrant integration in Wielkopolskie voivodship, Poland by supporting both migrants and host communities by providing migrants with reliable information on their rights and obligations in Poland, cultural orientation training, coaching and career counselling, and multilingual mobile application about educational, artistic and sport activities available in their area. The project will also support local integration initiatives aiming to support migrants in their environment (school, workplace, residence place, etc.) and to increase positive interactions between local communities and migrants.  Lastly, the project will provide capacity building of representatives of local institutions in working with migrants and integration of migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
